00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:46,280
three sentences. I'm sorry. I hope my

270
00:10:43,839 --> 00:10:49,000
death brings peace. I forgive everyone.

271
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:51,800
Noon. They come for you. Three guards,

272
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:54,440
