279
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:13,720
Straps across your chest, arms, legs.

280
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:15,760
The needle goes in. Saline first, cold.

281
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:18,440
The warden asks if you have any last

282
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:20,360
