283
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:22,280
Your voice doesn't shake. The victims

284
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:24,720
family's crying. Your daughter is

285
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:26,800
crying. You try to smile at her. The

286
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:29,760
warden gives the signal. The chemicals

287
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:31,880
